# Citation metadata for this repository.
# Validate with:  pip install cffconvert && cffconvert --validate
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this project, please cite both this software and the paper it reimplements."
title: "Educational reimplementation of a two-stage paediatric pneumonia ensemble"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-30
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A reproducible, educational reimplementation of the two weighted ensemble
  models for paediatric pneumonia described by Godbole et al. (2024): a
  Normal-vs-Pneumonia detection ensemble and a Bacterial-vs-Viral
  classification ensemble arranged as an inference cascade. The project
  reproduces the published architecture and Stage 1 ensemble weights, evaluates
  them on the official patient-disjoint Kermany test split, and reports the
  measured difference from the paper's figures together with a per-member
  failure analysis and a zero-retraining ablation.
keywords:
  - pneumonia
  - chest x-ray
  - ensemble methods
  - transfer learning
  - reproducibility
  - evaluation protocol
  - educational resource
authors:
  - name: "Pneumonia Treatment Project contributors"
    website: "https://example.org/pneumonia-treatment"
    # TODO: replace with your ORCID, name and affiliation before publishing.
